Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:12.39,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:18.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.17,0:00:25.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:31.47,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:48.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.93,0:00:54.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.17,0:01:01.27,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:07.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.89,0:01:13.72,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:25.17,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:40.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸一向将半妖犬夜叉当成族人的耻辱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:41.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对他非常的仇视
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:44.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照理说他也应该对人类非常的反感才对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:49.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的是杀生丸的手下邪见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.06,0:01:52.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身边却带着一个人类的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:56.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:00.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小玲被人给掳走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:03.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚奈落的分身神乐突然出现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:05.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把小玲给抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:12.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管放一百万个心吧 杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:20.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你肯乖乖听我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.69,0:02:21.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证那个叫小玲的小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.03,0:02:24.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会平安回到你的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:26.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落你这个大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.35,0:02:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要大功告成了 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.09,0:02:51.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你马上就会被我的这块肉消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:53.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候你就会成为我身体的一部分了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:57.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们沿路寻找四魂之玉碎片的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:03:02.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实大家都知道珊瑚的弟弟就是琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:05.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的体内被奈落藏了一块四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:08.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉单枪匹马进了奈落城
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.81,0:03:10.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有毒气还有瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:11.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:14.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里一定是奈落的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.88,0:03:18.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.35,0:03:22.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见了 看见奈落城了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:28.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第81话 奈落大坏蛋下落不明
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.74,0:03:45.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:48.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋神乐 难道连你都制服不了他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:52.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也留意到了城外的动静了是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.45,0:03:55.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我没那么多闲功夫陪你玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:01.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那一身的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:05.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那一身完美的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:08.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:12.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要变成我奈落的囊中物了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:27.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:32.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 这下糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:33.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷已经被…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.99,0:04:36.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人头杖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:41.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.50,0:04:42.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:05:01.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 千万不要有事才好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:10.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧 杀生丸少爷他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.75,0:05:30.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:43.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一身完美的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.39,0:05:45.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经被我完全给吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:47.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:50.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道？这就是你的原形吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:52.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:53.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:55.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:58.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会怕你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:21.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:25.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于找到你了 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.74,0:06:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我非消灭你不可
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:30.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别笑掉我的大牙了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.81,0:06:32.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然也想要打败我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:34.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么看来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:37.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的犬夜叉 或许能把奈落…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.75,0:06:41.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:44.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.76,0:06:47.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经将杀生丸的肉体化为己有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.89,0:06:50.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换句话说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.89,0:06:55.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不趁着奈落还没有完全取得妖力之前动手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.13,0:06:58.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等奈落完全消化那股妖力之后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.57,0:07:01.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉恐怕就没机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.78,0:07:08.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次是我失算
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:12.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到犬夜叉会采取这样的攻势
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.49,0:07:19.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你这臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:22.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为那么容易破除我的结界吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.43,0:07:26.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落你这个坏蛋 这次看你往哪逃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.16,0:07:28.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:33.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你使出吃奶的力气
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.44,0:07:35.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也奈何不了我神通广大的奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.11,0:07:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.11,0:07:41.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放马过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:53.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再接我一招
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.63,0:07:56.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:01.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:10.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:17.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的命运跟杀生丸完全一样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会变成我身体的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:23.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把杀生丸给…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子还是打不过奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.77,0:08:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在后悔已经太迟了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.23,0:08:40.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸已经变成我身体的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:42.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你这个半妖之力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底能给我补充多少能量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:46.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,献上来试试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.74,0:08:48.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我的力量更壮大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:52.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不想跟那个小子死在一起呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:08:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着受死吧 奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.29,0:09:00.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次我不会放过你的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:02.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.73,0:09:06.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.57,0:09:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:26.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:37.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说奈落 你不要笑死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.19,0:09:39.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包着我的那些肉片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.46,0:09:42.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然用来挡犬夜叉的风之伤 你真是幽默
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.27,0:09:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.30,0:09:46.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落由我来收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:48.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙是我的猎物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.47,0:09:50.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是开玩笑的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:52.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这小子一天到晚只会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:57.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个的狗命 今天全都是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:09:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:04.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃我一招
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:14.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为每次都有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:15.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃出我的手掌心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.93,0:10:18.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个死到临头还在作梦的死家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:31.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受死吧 看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:33.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你的狗命
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:43.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了这个猎物是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.97,0:10:59.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.98,0:11:06.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:09.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天跟你玩到这儿 下次再来较量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.39,0:11:16.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.89,0:11:20.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为一辈子都能逃出我的手掌心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:25.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与其想尽办法变身来追我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.17,0:11:31.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒不如早点去救跟着你的那位小姑娘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:37.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.58,0:11:40.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:43.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸身边的小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.09,0:11:45.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:50.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小玲现在跟一个叫琥珀的人在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:51.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟琥珀在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:54.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:58.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 相信你一定猜得到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.85,0:12:23.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸完美的妖力 就差那么一点就接收到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后关头居然功亏一篑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.73,0:12:30.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然变得这么厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:34.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然不能凭一招半式解决他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:39.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.88,0:12:42.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落居然消失得无影无踪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.75,0:12:44.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚受了那么重的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:47.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底会躲到什么地方去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:49.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:12:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道奈落掳走了你的人质吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.12,0:12:54.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个小玲难道是你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他掳走小玲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.13,0:12:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是为了争取时间逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:00.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:03.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个该死的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:15.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷别扔下我耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:20.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:22.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪见 你先跟我说清楚再走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.79,0:13:24.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落跟杀生丸之间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:26.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:29.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你这种半妖 我没兴趣跟你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这件事说来话长啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:34.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就长话短说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.57,0:13:39.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲着我们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:41.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:48.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来又是这些妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:50.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子是不想让我们过去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:55.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是琥珀回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.69,0:13:57.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还带了一个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.32,0:13:59.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:01.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像在哪里见过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:03.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:06.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部给我走开
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:11.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去追他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.07,0:14:13.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:21.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:24.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 刚才有没有看到琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.48,0:14:25.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该来得及追上他们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.98,0:14:28.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得四魂之玉碎片应该就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.99,0:14:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:31.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先走一步
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:34.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怕太慢会让他们跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:41.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说琥珀受到了奈落的控制
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:45.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信是奈落在给琥珀下达命令
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比方叫他杀掉人质等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:51.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落为了争取时间逃出杀生丸手中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.11,0:14:53.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会故意布下这个局
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:54.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照你这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.01,0:14:56.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀带回来的那个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.88,0:14:58.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是杀生丸的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.78,0:15:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到一向把人命看得那么不值钱的杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.12,0:15:04.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身边居然跟着一个人类女孩 让人难以相信
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:07.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有刚才他才被奈落耍了一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:10.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看他不会轻易放过奈落的手下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:13.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次杀生丸一定会杀了琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:15.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:18.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你哥哥杀生丸会杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.27,0:15:20.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 不管怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:22.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事一定不会有结局
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:26.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们必须比杀生丸抢先一步找到琥珀才行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.74,0:15:31.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想除了我之外也没有人拦得住杀生丸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.06,0:15:44.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:46.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么带我到这里来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:49.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚那间房子外面好像有人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:52.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们可以去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:53.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.68,0:16:08.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:29.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:38.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会这样 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.64,0:17:10.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想杀我是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:45.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:50.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.87,0:17:51.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:00.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:02.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子只不过昏过去而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:04.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸亏被我们给追上了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到了吧 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:09.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可别想杀了琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:12.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.49,0:18:14.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你出来搅局的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.96,0:18:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个臭小子正打算扑上来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:19.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我好好较量较量呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:28.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道这也是奈落的指示
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:29.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落要他激怒杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:32.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后死在杀生丸手上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然会替我挡掉小鬼手中的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:51.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来不知道你有这么为哥哥着想的一面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.73,0:18:53.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再废话连篇了 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再不放开你的手的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要砍下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:01.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准乱来 杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.78,0:19:10.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.68,0:19:13.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:15.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.89,0:19:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个眼神真的让我很不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:31.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你醒来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:34.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.84,0:19:39.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是不追啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.80,0:20:02.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:11.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:13.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你肯放过琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.31,0:20:15.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个小子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.05,0:20:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故意送上门来要我杀他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.55,0:20:20.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:22.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于想通这一点了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.75,0:20:28.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只不过不想那么傻中了奈落的诡计罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.47,0:20:40.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算让我们赶上了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:47.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.11,0:20:49.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说琥珀也走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.18,0:20:51.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我打赢奈落的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀就不会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.62,0:20:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不… 要是我们能够阻止他的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.42,0:20:59.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就不能怪你们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.13,0:21:05.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实只要琥珀还活着就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.10,0:21:07.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真搞不懂奈落那个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:09.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么突然间会失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.87,0:21:11.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上的伤那么重
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:14.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本连结界都张不了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:17.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.12,0:21:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.02,0:21:31.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留下解开结界的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:34.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:37.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是打算扔下整座城不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.39,0:21:42.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道 他又想要躲到别的地方去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.97,0:21:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.40,0:21:47.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得以前不管他藏在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.64,0:21:50.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都可以感觉到结界的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.94,0:21:54.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这次他真的完全消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:57.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点也感觉不到奈落存在的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.92,0:22:03.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是到底为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.39,0:22:21.92,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.20,0:22:28.66,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.94,0:22:35.37,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:41.68,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.95,0:22:48.52,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.76,0:22:55.60,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.07,0:23:02.47,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.74,0:23:09.11,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.28,0:23:15.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.06,0:23:22.48,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.03,0:23:29.46,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.67,0:23:36.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.58,0:23:51.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 奈落这家伙太卑鄙了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.51,0:23:53.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明只差一点点就追上他了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.91,0:23:57.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地 总算又回到现代来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.55,0:23:59.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.49,0:24:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说我们两个是不是调换身分了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.99,0:24:01.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的耶 身分对调了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.99,0:24:03.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下怎么做预告
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.76,0:24:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法了 照这样继续往下说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.49,0:24:07.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.99,0:24:09.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奔波于现代与战国之间
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.50,0:24:10.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得一定要收看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:12.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下回我有精彩演出 别忘了收看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.00,0:24:15.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算又换回来了
